<div class="breadcrumb">RELATÓRIOS / FAROL</div><div class="title-line"><div><h1>Relatório de farol</h1><p class="hint">Análise visual dos KPIs e emissão em formatos corporativos.</p></div></div>
<div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Exportar relatório de farol</h2></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="export-bar"><a class="button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/farol/pdf">Baixar PDF</a><a class="button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/farol/excel">Exportar Excel</a><a class="button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/farol/word">Gerar Word</a></div><p class="hint">Os arquivos são gerados no servidor com os dados persistidos no banco.</p></div></div>
<section class="columns"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Gráfico por situação</h2></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="chart" id="trafficChart"><span class="hint">Carregando indicadores...</span></div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Relatórios operacionais</h2></div><div class="panel-body"><p><b>Itens de controle</b></p><div class="export-bar"><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/itens-controle/pdf">PDF</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/itens-controle/excel">Excel</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/itens-controle/word">Word</a></div><p><b>Desdobramentos</b></p><div class="export-bar"><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/desdobramentos/pdf">PDF</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/desdobramentos/excel">Excel</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/desdobramentos/word">Word</a></div></div></div></section>
<script type="text/javascript">var xhr=new XMLHttpRequest();xhr.open('GET','${pageContext.request.contextPath}/relatorios/farol/dados',true);xhr.onreadystatechange=function(){if(xhr.readyState===4&&xhr.status===200){var a=JSON.parse(xhr.responseText),g=0,y=0,r=0,i,box=document.getElementById('trafficChart');for(i=0;i<a.length;i++){if(a[i].trafficColor==='GREEN')g++;else if(a[i].trafficColor==='YELLOW')y++;else r++;}box.innerHTML='<div style="height:'+(g*12+20)+'%;background:#36a66d"><span>'+g+'</span><i>VERDE</i></div><div style="height:'+(y*12+20)+'%;background:#efb02e"><span>'+y+'</span><i>AMARELO</i></div><div style="height:'+(r*12+20)+'%;background:#dd5555"><span>'+r+'</span><i>VERMELHO</i></div>';}};xhr.send(null);</script>
